n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8bAK3OXcFs8Q7kNvwF1Rk5r&_nc_oc=AdrKGGlaJ5mqXxaMSxCkOhrLYrFfwjjldOGtFi97jV-Cs-9vFRirRyFNWDGSD-qC9eE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQq_EHFkmMoaJhRTc-ayFXxBseiR-qw0PnWu4GUwaXOaw&oe=6AFB2712"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_5.png", "id": "1054923326081838", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819396_1054923329415171_5588401040978533705_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hr1QoEBqf-UQ7kNvwEyjqPy&_nc_oc=AdoLFJnGTsXxnhy6OsIdHchP_0tUwTUOYsVk_zHd0BvjwDI4UhtBhHZJKhIHiVTedpM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS4db0oWm39wIBT0KpJ8CajBMPZJtH8Lfg2ykHzqU4USw&oe=6AFB3E11"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Echo tag", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Echo Tag is a thrilling multiplayer stealth-action game where sound is your greatest weapon\u2014and your biggest risk. Set in a pitch-black arena where vision is stripped away, players must rely solely on audio cues and echolocation to hunt or evade their opponents.\n\nEach player emits sonar-like pings to reveal the world around them, momentarily illuminating the environment with sound waves. But every ping gives away your position\u2014so timing, strategy, and nerves of steel are everything. Will you risk making noise to see, or stay silent and hidden in the dark?\n\nPlay as a seeker or a runner in high-stakes rounds of tag, with customizable characters, dynamic maps, and game modes ranging from 1v1 duels to chaotic 6-player chases. With its unique audio-driven mechanics and tense, competitive gameplay, Echo Tag offers a fresh take on stealth and multiplayer action.\n\nWhether you're the predator or the prey, in Echo Tag, the darkness listens.", "short_description": "Echo Tag is a fast-paced multiplayer game where players use sound waves to locate, chase, and tag each other in a dark, echo